WEBVTT

00:00:25.570 --> 00:00:28.870
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.710 --> 00:00:34.110
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.310 --> 00:00:38.950
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:38.950 --> 00:00:43.450
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.020 --> 00:00:46.820
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.820 --> 00:00:51.400
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.660 --> 00:00:56.430
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.430 --> 00:00:59.100
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.100 --> 00:01:01.300
Give thanks!

00:01:01.300 --> 00:01:04.510
Let’s eat!

00:01:04.940 --> 00:01:10.310
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.310 --> 00:01:15.450
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.450 --> 00:01:20.720
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:20.990 --> 00:01:24.890
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.890 --> 00:01:30.970
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:30.970 --> 00:01:33.770
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.770 --> 00:01:36.340
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.340 --> 00:01:38.940
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:38.940 --> 00:01:43.210
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:49.220 --> 00:01:51.720
Someone once said...

00:01:52.520 --> 00:01:57.090
There are goldfish that swim in a 
river of the finest tomato sauce,

00:01:57.090 --> 00:02:04.000
their bodies made of superb, 
firm and chewy gnocchi...

00:02:05.300 --> 00:02:09.640
Gnoldfish!

00:02:11.670 --> 00:02:16.280
There are first-rate, refreshing, 
sweet and sour plums

00:02:16.280 --> 00:02:22.820
that grow in the form of 
a sparkling necklace...

00:02:22.820 --> 00:02:27.320
Plum Necklaces!

00:02:28.490 --> 00:02:32.130
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:32.230 --> 00:02:38.160
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:40.270 --> 00:02:44.400
Aiming to get IGO President 
Ichiryu's Full Course,

00:02:44.400 --> 00:02:47.470
Toriko headed to Biotope 8 with Terry.

00:02:48.410 --> 00:02:52.880
Meanwhile, while looking at 
a magazine, Komatsu found

00:02:52.880 --> 00:02:55.150
the name "Otake" on a chef ranking list.

00:02:56.020 --> 00:02:59.750
He was a friend who trained together 
with Komatsu back in the day.

00:03:00.090 --> 00:03:03.760
Komatsu and Otake reunited for 
the first time after many years,

00:03:03.760 --> 00:03:09.900
but Komatsu was confused by how 
ambitious his old friend had become.

00:03:10.200 --> 00:03:13.670
My goal is to stand at 
the top of the ranking.

00:03:16.440 --> 00:03:19.570
I'll do anything to get there.

00:03:20.340 --> 00:03:21.440
Y-You've kind of...

00:03:22.140 --> 00:03:25.110
...changed, Take-chan.

00:03:25.710 --> 00:03:27.950
And at Gourmet Corp,

00:03:27.950 --> 00:03:32.720
a conversation was taking place about taking 
chefs to the Gourmet World as slaves.

00:03:33.020 --> 00:03:36.090
Anyway, target the higher-ranking cooks.

00:03:36.520 --> 00:03:39.120
Attack restaurants that 
have seven stars or higher.

00:03:39.990 --> 00:03:43.930
Toriko met up with Coco, and together 
they journeyed through a cave.

00:03:44.460 --> 00:03:48.100
There, they came across a giant chest.

00:03:48.870 --> 00:03:52.070
The old man hid his appetizer 
in here, no two ways about it.

00:03:52.970 --> 00:03:56.970
But then, from deep within 
the cave, a giant Beast,

00:03:56.970 --> 00:04:01.140
Bajur Coq appeared, to guard the chest.

00:04:03.850 --> 00:04:08.080
Crossroads! A Chef's Destination!

00:04:13.820 --> 00:04:17.860
Bajur Coq (Avian Beast) Capture Level 74

00:04:21.760 --> 00:04:23.400
Take the food, Toriko.

00:04:23.800 --> 00:04:25.570
Thanks.

00:04:25.570 --> 00:04:27.640
Then I'll let you have him.

00:04:27.640 --> 00:04:29.910
In the meantime, get that 
treasure chest open.

00:04:29.910 --> 00:04:31.440
Count on it!

00:04:33.180 --> 00:04:34.740
Alright...

00:04:34.740 --> 00:04:39.320
I was no match for you as a kid, 
but things are different now.

00:04:44.590 --> 00:04:45.590
This way!

00:04:47.760 --> 00:04:50.530
This box is as big as I remember it.

00:04:50.530 --> 00:04:53.060
What the hell kinda ingredient is inside?

00:04:56.260 --> 00:05:00.240
Okay. I'm not the kid I was back then either.

00:05:00.240 --> 00:05:02.970
But I'll show you what I mean.

00:05:14.950 --> 00:05:17.290
36-fold...

00:05:17.290 --> 00:05:21.220
...Twin Spiked Punch!

00:05:40.540 --> 00:05:43.580
This is Fairytale Castle's 
fairy tale cuisine!

00:05:43.580 --> 00:05:46.210
How fairy tale-rrific!

00:05:46.210 --> 00:05:50.350
It's like we've really 
come to Fairytale Land!

00:05:50.350 --> 00:05:52.990
Oh, it's just a few things I had whipped up.

00:05:52.990 --> 00:05:57.290
No, it's wonderful! Now let's 
get down to taking photos.

00:05:58.960 --> 00:06:03.560
Huh? Are you Chef Komatsu of Hotel Gourmet?

00:06:03.560 --> 00:06:05.600
Y-Yes...

00:06:06.770 --> 00:06:11.540
Hello there! I'm Morita 
with <i>Calorie Magazine</i>.

00:06:11.540 --> 00:06:14.810
It's a pleasure to meet you!

00:06:15.210 --> 00:06:17.480
Nice to... meet you, too.

00:06:18.580 --> 00:06:20.350
Let's get to know each other better.

00:06:20.980 --> 00:06:22.780
Sure...

00:06:23.120 --> 00:06:24.220
Take the photo from there.

00:06:24.220 --> 00:06:24.880
Okay.

00:06:25.080 --> 00:06:26.120
From there, too.

00:06:26.120 --> 00:06:26.650
Gotcha.

00:06:26.920 --> 00:06:27.720
There too.

00:06:27.720 --> 00:06:28.250
Got it.

00:06:29.090 --> 00:06:30.120
And there.

00:06:30.120 --> 00:06:30.820
Right.

00:06:30.820 --> 00:06:32.620
Wow...

00:06:32.620 --> 00:06:34.130
This is taking up my time,

00:06:34.260 --> 00:06:35.490
so make sure you do a good job.

00:06:37.230 --> 00:06:39.300
This way, please, Chef Komatsu.

00:06:42.900 --> 00:06:44.400
Thank you for your patience.

00:06:45.940 --> 00:06:51.140
Wow, thank you! Huh? This is...

00:06:51.680 --> 00:06:54.880
...a Cotton Candy Cloud and a Beeswax Candle!

00:06:55.250 --> 00:06:57.720
How can he afford high-grade 
ingredients like this?

00:06:57.720 --> 00:06:58.850
Here.

00:06:59.850 --> 00:07:02.320
It's my menu. Go ahead and print it.

00:07:03.590 --> 00:07:05.460
I'm sorry to trouble you all the time.

00:07:08.430 --> 00:07:11.130
I'm expecting a good article.

00:07:19.700 --> 00:07:20.470
Toriko!

00:07:22.670 --> 00:07:25.110
That punch was amazing!

00:07:30.150 --> 00:07:31.080
This way!

00:07:44.330 --> 00:07:48.160
You can't touch me anymore.

00:08:07.080 --> 00:08:09.020
Poison Armor!

00:08:18.390 --> 00:08:21.560
Poison Sword!

00:08:34.380 --> 00:08:36.680
That was fast! You beat it already?!

00:08:36.680 --> 00:08:37.450
Yeah.

00:08:38.110 --> 00:08:40.510
I just put to sleep for 
a while with my poison.

00:08:41.080 --> 00:08:45.290
But forget that! A Spiked Punch 
with both arms, Toriko? Incredible!

00:08:46.120 --> 00:08:50.120
The reason I thought you should try 
to take a crack at the treasure chest

00:08:50.890 --> 00:08:53.460
is that I remembered your punch.

00:08:53.460 --> 00:08:56.430
But it didn't work. It didn't even budge.

00:08:56.430 --> 00:08:58.170
Feels like my arms are gonna give out.

00:08:58.170 --> 00:08:59.700
Oh, I wouldn't say that.

00:09:02.340 --> 00:09:04.940
That punch you just gave it really weakened

00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:07.810
the powerful electromagnetic 
waves the box is giving off.

00:09:07.810 --> 00:09:10.510
There's a good chance it'll 
open with one more try!

00:09:10.710 --> 00:09:12.550
Can you do it, Toriko?!

00:09:18.920 --> 00:09:20.350
Course I can!

00:09:20.920 --> 00:09:22.090
Toriko...

00:09:22.420 --> 00:09:25.090
No matter how impressive 
the ingredient you procure,

00:09:25.090 --> 00:09:30.360
it isn't worth a damn unless you 
have someone who can cook it.

00:09:30.530 --> 00:09:33.200
Like with my Full Course...

00:09:33.830 --> 00:09:36.070
The old man's Full Course...

00:09:43.340 --> 00:09:47.080
Right now, there are plenty of 
talented chefs all over the world.

00:09:47.710 --> 00:09:50.380
I'm sure there's someone who'll cook it.

00:09:51.320 --> 00:09:53.050
I'll find the one...

00:09:53.490 --> 00:09:55.090
I know I will!

00:09:55.420 --> 00:09:58.090
So show me

00:09:58.490 --> 00:10:00.390
the old man's Full Course!

00:10:02.690 --> 00:10:04.900
36-fold...

00:10:04.900 --> 00:10:10.100
...Twin Spiked Punch!

00:10:23.010 --> 00:10:24.780
No good?!

00:10:37.260 --> 00:10:38.700
Yes, indeed!

00:10:39.100 --> 00:10:41.600
We got everything we needed today.

00:10:41.600 --> 00:10:43.530
It's a pleasure doing business with you.

00:10:44.200 --> 00:10:47.170
Oh no, it's a pleasure 
doing business with <i>you</i>.

00:10:52.440 --> 00:10:55.240
How is it, Koma-chan? Our 
food is good, isn't it?

00:10:56.050 --> 00:10:58.110
It really is amazing.

00:10:58.110 --> 00:11:01.120
I know, right? It <i>should</i> be delicious.

00:11:01.320 --> 00:11:03.790
It certainly costs enough!

00:11:03.790 --> 00:11:06.920
I get ingredients that rarely 
even make it to the marketplace.

00:11:07.960 --> 00:11:10.060
Top ingredients...

00:11:10.260 --> 00:11:11.960
Take-chan...

00:11:29.910 --> 00:11:32.750
We want you to gather

00:11:32.750 --> 00:11:37.090
the world's best chefs, 
securely and efficiently.

00:11:37.790 --> 00:11:39.520
And be quick about it.

00:11:39.650 --> 00:11:42.090
Do whatever you have to do.

00:11:42.090 --> 00:11:44.730
Alright. Leave it to me.

00:12:11.250 --> 00:12:13.520
Information about new ingredients...

00:12:13.520 --> 00:12:16.590
Hiring Gourmet Hunters... Buying up stock...

00:12:16.590 --> 00:12:19.860
It's all possible with money.

00:12:21.630 --> 00:12:24.360
Whenever I find a somewhat 
interesting ingredient,

00:12:24.360 --> 00:12:27.630
curious investors beat a path to my door.

00:12:28.000 --> 00:12:29.270
That's the Gourmet Age.

00:12:29.970 --> 00:12:31.570
And then you just need publicity.

00:12:31.570 --> 00:12:35.640
I pull in the customers by spending 
a huge amount on advertising,

00:12:35.640 --> 00:12:37.180
for the media exposure.

00:12:37.640 --> 00:12:39.680
Never forgetting under-the-table deals...

00:12:40.410 --> 00:12:43.120
Getting customers is a cinch this way.

00:12:43.120 --> 00:12:46.790
For some customers, eating at a first-class 
restaurant is just a status symbol.

00:12:46.790 --> 00:12:49.460
Those idiots don't know a thing about taste.

00:12:49.460 --> 00:12:53.030
They spend money like it grows on trees.

00:12:53.330 --> 00:12:55.390
What do you think? Simple, right?

00:12:56.300 --> 00:12:58.930
It's not good to talk 
about customers like that!

00:13:00.530 --> 00:13:03.640
Are you telling me you make 
under-the-table deals with the media

00:13:03.640 --> 00:13:06.970
so they'll hype your restaurant?!

00:13:07.770 --> 00:13:11.540
The magazine writer came here for 
a story but didn't eat a bite

00:13:12.080 --> 00:13:17.050
because he already knew what he 
was going to write, I'll bet!

00:13:19.320 --> 00:13:22.050
That's right. Anything wrong with that?

00:13:23.590 --> 00:13:26.660
Take-chan! Bribery is a crime!

00:13:26.660 --> 00:13:29.330
It's not like I tell them to write lies.

00:13:29.930 --> 00:13:32.800
My food really is delicious!

00:13:32.800 --> 00:13:37.530
If it's really delicious, then you 
shouldn't have to go to all that trouble!

00:13:37.530 --> 00:13:38.970
You don't understand!

00:13:38.970 --> 00:13:42.240
For stupid customers, that 
information is everything!

00:13:42.240 --> 00:13:42.940
Listen to me!

00:13:42.940 --> 00:13:47.040
Even customer satisfaction is decided by 
the surveys those stupid customers take!

00:13:47.310 --> 00:13:49.450
You call your customers "stupid"...

00:14:09.600 --> 00:14:11.470
When it comes to cooking, you've got to...

00:14:12.270 --> 00:14:14.440
...treasure your customers, 
the people who eat your food!

00:14:15.670 --> 00:14:20.610
My restaurant has moved up to 
seven stars by doing it this way!

00:14:21.110 --> 00:14:22.850
It's what everyone does.

00:14:22.850 --> 00:14:24.580
That's not true!

00:14:24.880 --> 00:14:26.850
There's someone...

00:14:26.850 --> 00:14:32.020
There's someone who taught 
me how precious eating is!

00:14:37.390 --> 00:14:39.690
One more punch, Toriko!

00:14:41.400 --> 00:14:42.330
Yeah!

00:14:45.070 --> 00:14:48.100
I've been through a lot of tough training...

00:14:56.840 --> 00:14:59.050
And now I'm gonna show you the results!

00:15:04.550 --> 00:15:06.720
I'll punch this thing as 
many times as it takes!

00:15:06.890 --> 00:15:10.060
Hold on, chefs of the world!

00:15:14.530 --> 00:15:20.570
This is the president of IGO's...

00:15:21.300 --> 00:15:24.100
...appetizer!

00:15:36.520 --> 00:15:36.920
I...

00:15:37.020 --> 00:15:38.080
You did it!

00:15:38.350 --> 00:15:40.550
The treasure chest is open!

00:15:47.260 --> 00:15:49.060
Strong electromagnetic waves...

00:15:59.810 --> 00:16:00.640
You're naive!

00:16:00.640 --> 00:16:02.110
Wrong!

00:16:40.180 --> 00:16:41.880
That was...

00:16:41.880 --> 00:16:45.050
...something I've been through 
several times before...

00:16:45.520 --> 00:16:49.150
The moment I can hear the 
voice of an ingredient...

00:16:54.830 --> 00:16:57.090
Heave-ho!

00:17:27.720 --> 00:17:28.160
Wha...?!

00:17:28.790 --> 00:17:30.530
What the hell is this?!

00:17:45.440 --> 00:17:46.440
A bean?

00:17:46.440 --> 00:17:49.110
It also looks like it might 
be some type of seed...

00:17:49.280 --> 00:17:52.510
For some reason, the wavelength of the 
electromagnetic waves has gotten weaker.

00:17:53.520 --> 00:17:56.020
Maybe it isn't any big deal...

00:17:56.020 --> 00:17:58.150
Damn you, old man!

00:17:58.350 --> 00:18:01.420
I was convinced you had a 
real treat locked up in here!

00:18:01.660 --> 00:18:05.560
In any case, if this is part 
of the president's Full Course,

00:18:05.890 --> 00:18:08.930
I think we'll need to 
investigate it thoroughly.

00:18:11.230 --> 00:18:14.570
W-What was that?

00:18:16.700 --> 00:18:19.070
Take-chan could hear it too?

00:18:27.550 --> 00:18:31.050
Wait, you must be jealous of me, Koma-chan!

00:18:31.950 --> 00:18:34.450
You're envious that I've achieved 
great success before you,

00:18:34.450 --> 00:18:38.290
and even made it into the top 100 ranking!

00:18:40.060 --> 00:18:42.100
That's why you're acting so high and mighty!

00:18:42.100 --> 00:18:44.300
You're raising a stink 
because you're jealous!

00:18:46.570 --> 00:18:48.840
You really have changed...

00:18:49.470 --> 00:18:50.070
...Take-chan.

00:18:52.610 --> 00:18:55.070
You weren't like this back then...

00:18:57.340 --> 00:18:58.710
More than this place,

00:19:00.010 --> 00:19:01.050
or the customers...

00:19:04.920 --> 00:19:06.050
More than anything...

00:19:12.020 --> 00:19:14.490
...I feel sorry for the ingredients!

00:19:21.770 --> 00:19:25.070
Well, I'll be going.

00:19:25.600 --> 00:19:27.510
If you can't stand it...

00:19:29.070 --> 00:19:32.080
If you can't stand it, 
try to do better than me!

00:19:34.810 --> 00:19:38.080
I have no intention of competing 
with you, Take-chan.

00:19:41.820 --> 00:19:44.320
My partner, Toriko-san, and I

00:19:45.490 --> 00:19:48.030
are aiming for the top in our own way!

00:20:19.320 --> 00:20:20.320
Take-chan...

00:21:55.580 --> 00:21:58.490
This week's Gourmet Fortune!

00:21:58.490 --> 00:22:01.390
Okay, please choose one 
of these three platters.

00:22:02.660 --> 00:22:05.860
The higher the capture level, 
the more Gourmet Luck it has!

00:22:06.630 --> 00:22:08.330
Alright, here we go!

00:22:08.330 --> 00:22:10.100
A heaping helping...

00:22:11.300 --> 00:22:14.030
Open!

00:22:14.430 --> 00:22:17.070
This week's best Gourmet Luck is...

00:22:17.870 --> 00:22:24.740
C - Barbamoth Capture Level 44

00:22:18.500 --> 00:22:20.240
...yours if you chose C!

00:22:20.240 --> 00:22:21.770
Everything will go smoothly!

00:22:21.770 --> 00:22:24.640
And if you exercise, your Gourmet 
Luck will be greater still!

00:22:24.740 --> 00:22:32.120
B - Dangol Capture Level 40

00:22:25.810 --> 00:22:29.010
If you chose B, you get this 
week's second-best luck.

00:22:29.010 --> 00:22:32.050
Even if you get off to a bad start, 
it'll get better and better.

00:22:32.120 --> 00:22:38.560
A - Cookie Alpaca Capture Level 5

00:22:32.790 --> 00:22:36.160
And I'm sorry. If you chose A, you're third.

00:22:36.320 --> 00:22:38.560
Don't be misled by appearances.

00:22:38.560 --> 00:22:42.030
Good Luck Charm Photo Time

00:22:39.060 --> 00:22:42.030
And finally, it's Gourmet 
Good Luck Charm photo time!

00:22:42.460 --> 00:22:44.160
Alright, here we go!

00:22:44.460 --> 00:22:48.230
3... 2... 1... Scoop Chance!

00:22:48.670 --> 00:22:51.140
Fortify yourself with a meal

00:22:51.700 --> 00:22:56.740
and give thanks for all of 
this world's great bounty!

00:22:57.210 --> 00:22:59.540
I'd better fortify myself with a meal too

00:22:59.540 --> 00:23:02.080
so I'll be ready for whenever a scoop comes!

00:23:02.750 --> 00:23:04.950
But before that, please take 
a look at the next segment!

00:23:07.080 --> 00:23:10.420
Time to freshen things up with a new haircut. And you only need one kind...

00:23:10.670 --> 00:23:14.230
Something manly, and cool looking. Wait, that's going overboard!

00:23:14.460 --> 00:23:17.330
Dramatic Transformation! Hair Salon Barber Gourmet!

00:23:17.560 --> 00:23:19.200
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
